Malis's mum works in an office. Her uncle works in a factory that makes bicycles. Aunt Srey cooks in a restaurant. Grandpa works on a farm. A scientist works in a laboratory. An artist paints in a studio. Cousin Vibol works at the hotel reception, and his friend writes for a newspaper.

